GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get specific user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### update a user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "email": "user@test2.com"
}

### Delete specific user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

